{{file improvement}}

A second picture for the [[poolside-style|Poolside style]], this time from the side: a white deck with an orange diving board, a pool wall with round depth markers, a ladder at the far end and a striped life ring floating on the waterline. The orange stays crisp and solid, and the water runs from cyan to blue. Drawn as a vector image, so it stays sharp at any size!
